{"id":"a3cb4e8004646c0c","group":"58","path":"58/batch14/58-df-non-degenerate.md","title":"Nondegenerate","display":"df-non-degenerate — Nondegenerate","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Set Theory","book_abbrev":"58","label":"58-df-non-degenerate","aliases":["58-df-non-degenerate"],"display":"df-non-degenerate — Nondegenerate","depends_on":["[[../batch16/58-df-function.md]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Set Theory"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"58"},{"key":"label","html":"58-df-non-degenerate"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>58-df-non-degenerate</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-non-degenerate — Nondegenerate"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"36d7463d215be751\" href=\"?note=36d7463d215be751\" title=\"../batch16/58-df-function.md\">../batch16/58-df-function.md</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"V,W,K,B\\in V\">\\(V,W,K,B\\in V\\)</span>.</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Function}\\subseteq V^3\">\\(\\mathrm{Function}\\subseteq V^3\\)</span> (see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"36d7463d215be751\" href=\"?note=36d7463d215be751\" title=\"../batch16/58-df-function.md\">../batch16/58-df-function.md</a>).</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{NonDegenerate}_S\\subseteq V^3\">\\(\\mathrm{NonDegenerate}_S\\subseteq V^3\\)</span>.</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}non\\text{-}degenerate} \\vdash\n\\mathrm{NonDegenerate}_S(B,V,W) \\leftrightarrow\n\\exists K\\in V\\;(0\\in K\\land\\mathrm{Function}(B,V\\times W,K))\\land\n\\bigl(\\forall v\\in V\\,((\\forall w\\in W\\,(B(v,w)=0))\\to v=0)\\bigr)\\land\n\\bigl(\\forall w\\in W\\,((\\forall v\\in V\\,(B(v,w)=0))\\to w=0)\\bigr)\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}non\\text{-}degenerate} \\vdash\n\\mathrm{NonDegenerate}_S(B,V,W) \\leftrightarrow\n\\exists K\\in V\\;(0\\in K\\land\\mathrm{Function}(B,V\\times W,K))\\land\n\\bigl(\\forall v\\in V\\,((\\forall w\\in W\\,(B(v,w)=0))\\to v=0)\\bigr)\\land\n\\bigl(\\forall w\\in W\\,((\\forall v\\in V\\,(B(v,w)=0))\\to w=0)\\bigr)\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>Nondegeneracy means neither argument has a nonzero annihilator.</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"../batch16/58-df-function.md","status":"resolved","id":"36d7463d215be751","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch16/58-df-function.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch16/58-df-function.md","status":"resolved","id":"36d7463d215be751","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathrm{Function}\\subseteq V^3$ (see [[../batch16/58-df-function.md]]).","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"V,W,K,B\\in V","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Function}\\subseteq V^3","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{NonDegenerate}_S\\subseteq V^3","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}non\\text{-}degenerate} \\vdash\n\\mathrm{NonDegenerate}_S(B,V,W) \\leftrightarrow\n\\exists K\\in V\\;(0\\in K\\land\\mathrm{Function}(B,V\\times W,K))\\land\n\\bigl(\\forall v\\in V\\,((\\forall w\\in W\\,(B(v,w)=0))\\to v=0)\\bigr)\\land\n\\bigl(\\forall w\\in W\\,((\\forall v\\in V\\,(B(v,w)=0))\\to w=0)\\bigr)","display":true}],"bytes":818,"backlinks":[{"id":"297834c6f058cefe","anchor":"ref-2","locations":["元数据 · depends_on"],"count":1,"excer